From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 18:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/24] feat: add CinematicCamera plugin with physically-based
 optics

Physically-based camera entity component: FOV from focal length and
sensor size, thin-lens DOF, manual exposure locking EV min/max to the
aperture/shutter/ISO EV100 so the f-number actually drives brightness.
Includes focal-length detents (prime lens set / geometric), a Focus
Falloff factor that maps physical DOF width onto the engine's ramp-only
DOF shader, opt-in game-start activation, and a game-mode camera
takeover in UpdateBeforeFinalizeCamera (the engine's sanctioned final
override point, after the GameSDK ViewSystem).

Exports CryGetCinematicCameraOptics so other plugins can drive the lens
at runtime without linking (Interface/ICinematicCameraOptics.h).

